WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.080
"At the close of the age of fire,

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:08.660
all lands meet at the end of the Earth.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.150
Great Kingdoms and anemic

00:00:12.849 --> 00:00:14.939
townships will be one and the same.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:21.659
A great tide of human enterprise - all for naught.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:27.449
That's why I'm so taken by this grand sight

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:32.669
This must be what it's like to be a god"

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.050
Welcome, everyone, to the Ringed City.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.829
So I can show you ten minutes

00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:43.079
of this first level and then I can show you about five minutes of the boss.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:48.240
I got this Splitleaf Greatsword from the hag just before and it's really good.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:59.260
Don't judge me. She saw me die. It was embarrassing, she had to go;

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:05.080
but as she died she said something about hoping to see an angel

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:08.220
And, it looks like she just missed it. Damn.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:14.380
Actually, I'm pretty sure it's her death that caused this angel to spawn

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:17.820
because I've never seen it here before her death

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.380
but we'll talk about the angels more later

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.280
The first weapon we have in our sights is the Aquamarine Dagger.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:28.580
Which is just beyond this Harald Legion knight

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:35.300
The Harald Legion, according to their gear, once came here seeking the Dark Soul.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:42.540
However, they eventually sank into the dark; their weapons corroding and their bodies bloating

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.340
And we don't know yet: maybe they did find the Dark Soul in some capacity

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:51.759
For their head appears to be this swirling mass of humanity

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.440
Which if you jump attack it can save you a difficult fight

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:02.890
Above is the lightsaber - I mean Aquamarine Dagger, and it has a weapon art

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:06.160
That's like Freida's scythe where it extends the blade and your move set at the cost of some movement speed and focus

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:10.640
and your move set at the cost of some movement speed and focus

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.280
The dagger reads "It is fitted with aquamarine crystals

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:20.560
and engraved with a prayer in the old tongue to ward off incidents."

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:25.119
Perhaps it is a parting gift given to one sent out on great travels

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.860
It's quite effective against these Murkmen

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:32.000
and the Murkmen are like human corpses that are corroded by the dark

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:36.200
Some, as you'll see here, are possessed by Souldregs

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:40.899
which, and I quote, "have a grave likeness to the human form."

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:49.600
Apparently you can destroy these Souldregs as they fly towards you-look at this

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:55.800
I only figured this out because I rolled with the Thorns armor on, which does damage when you roll, and

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:59.130
That probably would have been really useful information in this scenario:

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:07.289
But back to the dagger. I think this will be a top-tier weapon in terms of Fashion and in terms of damage

00:03:07.289 --> 00:03:12.080
It's pretty great against humanoid enemies because it can stun lock them,

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.940
but as you'll see during the boss fight later

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.480
Activating the weapon art can be a bit of a liability

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.700
Next, the angel.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:27.900
If you have a keen eye, then you would have noticed this pillar of light in the distance

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:35.180
It illuminates at the same time the angel appeared so I ran down there to check it out and then:

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:48.220
This pillar breaks through a cathedral wall and reveals the path to Lapp, the amnesiac Hollow.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:55.200
"Oh, look at you. You've got your head screwed on correct. Fantastic

00:03:56.629 --> 00:04:02.259
To miss a kindred spirit on this gods-forsaken crag. call me Lapp

00:04:03.079 --> 00:04:05.079
I-I can't remember my real name, so

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:09.170
let's just go with that. I have a feeling we're going to make a fabulous team."

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:13.300
He just said we'd make a fabulous team. Where's the team work?

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:16.940
I feel like it's not in this guy's character to help me.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.940
Let's try again

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:22.300
"Oh, you'll see - you'll see!"

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.240
"Ohh,

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:32.199
In all honesty there's something. I should tell you... I'm... a Hollow

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:37.180
Yes, I try to play it off

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:42.360
But I haven't a clue about my past. Who I was, or what I lived for.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.492
Not even my own blessed name.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:50.580
That's why I've come here searching. For the Purging Monument

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:56.100
Said to be in the Ringed City where the pygmies, who found the Dark Soul at the dawn of fire, reside.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.900
All I can say is...

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:03.200
Those little stones aren't doing much to help me remember anymore..."

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:07.060
The little stones he's talking about are obviously Purging Stones,

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:14.020
which are commonly used in Londor to cure Hollowing and to stave off the Undead Curse

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:18.340
And for someone who is as immortal as Lapp

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:23.660
Whose identity we were pretty sure of in the last video if you want to spoil it.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:29.320
Apparently for him even these stones stop being effective after a while

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:33.340
Back down below Lapp is our original target

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:38.040
Which was this thing which I've started calling the "Londor Grower"

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:45.660
It's this fleshy parasite that appears to be attached over the shell of a dead Pilgrim and

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:51.280
I always assumed that the shells were like those shells that you saw on the blue robed clerics

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:55.779
which state that the shells keep out the puss of man.

00:05:55.940 --> 00:06:00.260
Which is that black muck that had infested the rest of Lothric.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:06.700
So the fact that this avatar, this parasite, appears over the shell of the Pilgrim

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.400
leads me to believe that whatever this creature is

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.729
its what the pilgrim wanted to become.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:20.980
after all it's kind of like a caterpillar becoming butterfly after the Cocoon phase and

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.360
after all the pilgrims of Londor,

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:28.689
as we learn from Yoel, were destined to die and craved death

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:33.940
So perhaps this rebirth into an angel is their goal and

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:38.200
I guess for Hollows it is a more powerful form

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:42.249
and this certainly is a step forward - at least in terms of evolution.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:47.680
But what is their goal now? That's what we've yet to discover.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:51.309
A bunch more pilgrims can be found in this arena

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:54.190
where you fight one more Harald Knight

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:59.739
and beyond this a drop down into the next zone that I'm not allowed to show you.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.800
But I am allowed to show you this:

00:07:06.849 --> 00:07:08.659
"Far below,

00:07:08.659 --> 00:07:11.600
there's a deep dark hole

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:14.050
carved out of a tree

00:07:14.719 --> 00:07:16.719
from time to time

00:07:16.849 --> 00:07:20.979
voices brim from the Depths of the Cavity even now

00:07:22.099 --> 00:07:27.669
Mutterings of a merry Demon that Prince Lorian spoke of I'm sure

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.600
Horrible sounds of an afflicted thing

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.080
yet cursing men."

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.398
The Demon Prince.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.700
This fight has changed.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:43.980
Where in a previous patch you were only beset by one Demon at the start

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:49.540
Now there are two at the start, though I'd argue that they do a bit less damage now from what I remember

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:53.520
The boss really shouldn't be called the Demon from Below

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:57.540
It should be called camera because that's what you're really fighting.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.960
Though it's not a bad fight. It's quite good.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:04.100
It just gets a little too chaotic at times in my opinion.

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:07.320
So the main mechanic when there's two of them is this

00:08:07.699 --> 00:08:11.109
When a demon is red that means it's powered up

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:16.089
And it means that it will tend towards using fire-imbued melee attacks

00:08:16.699 --> 00:08:21.998
Eventually though it will lose that flame with a slam attack and then will resort to

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:26.700
poison, toxic and corrosion until it powers up again and

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:30.500
This poison form is where most of your damage should come in

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.680
and it's also where the Demon Prince will come out

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:37.180
The Demon Prince, after his defeat to Lorian,

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.240
Retreated beneath the Earth

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:45.420
and lost the memory of the flame that burned within him, marking the end of Demon-kind.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:50.940
The weapons from his soul of the Last Flames kindled by the Prince and

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:54.060
with the death of the Old Demon King in the overworld

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:58.360
surely these mark the end of Chaos and it's Demons.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.650
One fact remains the same here though:

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:14.650
Depending on which one you kill first the move set of the Demon Prince will change

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:18.820
so if you kill the one on the right, the Demon in Pain, first

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:23.320
You'll face a version of the Demon Prince with laser attacks

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:26.960
and this version is far easier in my opinion because he's at a-

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:27.560
(...)

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:28.790
Yeah...

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.280
just don't get hit.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:34.780
And if you kill the one on the left first, the Demon from Below

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:40.140
Then it will lead to a Demon Prince fight with true Chaos flame attacks

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:44.220
he summons these orbs that bombard you from a distance and

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:48.580
This meteor storm that I could never effectively dodge.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:53.000
It killed me so hard that it fucking broke my editing software

00:09:55.400 --> 00:10:01.320
Ultimately though, this boss is undone by a high stability, high fire resistant shield

00:10:01.699 --> 00:10:05.558
You don't even need to dodge really just use the Black Knight shield.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:11.200
So the last thing I want to leave you on is this:

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.360
I think it's a good statement to go into the DLC with

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.300
from a lore point of view anyway,

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:21.820
so the Harald knights came down here seeking the Dark Soul and they failed.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:27.560
A wanderer apparently on "great travels" was given the Aquamarine Dagger

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:32.940
and left it behind and I think that maybe Prince Lothric (Lorian) might has been here, too

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:37.740
Since he defeated the Demon Prince before it burrowed deep beneath the ground

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:43.480
nursing it's wounds. And of course Gail is summonable for this fight

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:45.480
and we know why he's down here.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:50.439
All of these people likely where here looking for the dark soul

00:10:50.869 --> 00:10:52.730
and the question becomes:

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:55.280
Why were they seeking the Dark Soul?

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.940
What powers does it have and

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:02.840
can it really create a new world as Gail and Arya hope for?

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.620
One more week and we'll know.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.720
Thank you for watching.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:12.040
Also, if you want to learn everything we currently know about the Ringed city

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.500
albeit without footage to back it up

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.000
You can watch this video,

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.860
and I believe there's a new trailer dropping soon

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.060
so go and check that out.

00:11:21.079 --> 00:11:23.079
Thank you for watching.

